    <content>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"a2f10004-1001-4000-b004-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"a2f10004-2001-4000-b004-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Content tree, page types, Block Grid, navigation and multilingual"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Content Editing Guide"},{"alias":"content","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"a2f10004-3001-4000-b004-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EContent Editing Guide\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThis guide is for content editors who build and maintain the website in the Umbraco backoffice.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EContent Tree\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EuTPro organises content around a shared root and per-site nodes:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGlobal Root\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 container, no URL\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFolder Sites \u2192 Home\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 the site root (Page Home)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFolder Navigation Link\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 holds the menu\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFolder Settings\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 favicon, logo, sitemap settings\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/content-tree.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Content Tree\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EPage Types\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth\u003EDoc type\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003EUse for\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPage Home\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe single site root with navigation config\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPage Standard\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery normal content page\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBoth page types render three Block Grid areas: Top Component (inherited), Content (per page), Bottom Component (inherited).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EBuilding a Page with Block Grid\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a page \u2192 Content property (Block Grid editor)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd content\u003C/strong\u003E and pick a component\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill fields, then Save or Save and publish\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EReorder blocks by dragging; delete via context menu\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/content-blockgrid-editor.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Block Grid Editor\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ENavigation Menu\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe header menu is editor-built under Home \u2192 Folder Navigation Link \u2192 Items property. Each entry supports: Link, CSS classes, hidden toggle, children (multi-level), member-aware visibility.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESEO per Page\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEach page has SEO fields via UmbracoSeoVisualizer: Title, Description, Keywords, Social Share Image, Open Graph, Twitter Card, Sitemap controls (noindex/nofollow, change frequency, priority).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EMultilingual Content\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EConfigure languages under Settings \u2192 Languages. Set Culture and Hostnames on the Home node. Edit each page\u0027s variant per language. The language switcher appears automatically when multiple languages are active.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/content-language-switcher.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Language Switcher\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"a2f10004-3001-4000-b004-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"a2f10004-3001-4000-b004-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"a2f10004-4001-4000-b004-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"a2f10004-5001-4000-b004-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"a2f10004-1001-4000-b004-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null},{"contentKey":"a2f10004-2001-4000-b004-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"a2f10004-2001-4000-b004-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"a2f10004-5001-4000-b004-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"a2f10004-1001-4000-b004-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"a2f10004-4001-4000-b004-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="vi-VN"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"d1f20007-1001-4000-b007-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"d1f20007-2001-4000-b007-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Content tree, page types, Block Grid v\u00E0 \u0111a ng\u00F4n ng\u1EEF"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"H\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn Qu\u1EA3n l\u00FD N\u1ED9i dung"},{"alias":"content","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"d1f20007-3001-4000-b007-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EH\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn Qu\u1EA3n l\u00FD N\u1ED9i dung\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EH\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn n\u00E0y d\u00E0nh cho content editor x\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng v\u00E0 duy tr\u00EC website trong Umbraco backoffice.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EContent Tree\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EuTPro t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c n\u1ED9i dung quanh root chung v\u00E0 c\u00E1c node theo site:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGlobal Root\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 container, kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 URL\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFolder Sites \u2192 Home\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 g\u1ED1c site (Page Home)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFolder Navigation Link\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 ch\u1EE9a menu\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFolder Settings\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 favicon, logo, c\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t sitemap\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EPage Types\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth\u003EDoc type\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003ES\u1EED d\u1EE5ng cho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPage Home\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG\u1ED1c site duy nh\u1EA5t v\u1EDBi c\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh navigation\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPage Standard\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EM\u1ECDi trang n\u1ED9i dung th\u00F4ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003Cp\u003EC\u1EA3 hai page types render ba v\u00F9ng Block Grid: Top Component (k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa), Content (theo trang), Bottom Component (k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EX\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng Trang v\u1EDBi Block Grid\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EM\u1EDF trang \u2192 thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh Content (Block Grid editor)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENh\u1EA5n \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd content\u003C/strong\u003E v\u00E0 ch\u1ECDn component\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u0110i\u1EC1n c\u00E1c field, sau \u0111\u00F3 Save ho\u1EB7c Save and publish\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ES\u1EAFp x\u1EBFp l\u1EA1i blocks b\u1EB1ng k\u00E9o th\u1EA3; x\u00F3a qua context menu\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ENavigation Menu\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMenu header \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o b\u1EDFi editor t\u1EA1i Home \u2192 Folder Navigation Link \u2192 Items. M\u1ED7i m\u1EE5c h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3: Link, CSS classes, \u1EA9n/hi\u1EC7n, children (\u0111a c\u1EA5p), hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB theo member.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESEO theo Trang\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EM\u1ED7i trang c\u00F3 c\u00E1c field SEO qua UmbracoSeoVisualizer: Title, Description, Keywords, Social Share Image, Open Graph, Twitter Card, Sitemap controls (noindex/nofollow, change frequency, priority).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EN\u1ED9i dung \u0110a ng\u00F4n ng\u1EEF\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EC\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh ng\u00F4n ng\u1EEF t\u1EA1i Settings \u2192 Languages. Thi\u1EBFt l\u1EADp Culture and Hostnames tr\u00EAn node Home. Ch\u1EC9nh s\u1EEDa variant c\u1EE7a m\u1ED7i trang theo ng\u00F4n ng\u1EEF. Language switcher t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n khi nhi\u1EC1u ng\u00F4n ng\u1EEF \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\u00EDch ho\u1EA1t.\u003C/p\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f20007-3001-4000-b007-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"d1f20007-3001-4000-b007-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f20007-4001-4000-b007-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f20007-5001-4000-b007-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f20007-1001-4000-b007-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null},{"contentKey":"d1f20007-2001-4000-b007-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"d1f20007-2001-4000-b007-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"d1f20007-5001-4000-b007-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"d1f20007-1001-4000-b007-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"d1f20007-4001-4000-b007-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
